<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo><data>
<template id="s_mk_services" name="OG Services">
    <section id="services" class="mk-services" data-snippet="s_mk_services" data-name="OG 服務項目">
        <div class="container position-relative">
            <h2 class="mk-sec-title">服務</h2>
            <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
            <div class="mk-why-title">Why O.G?</div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">01</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading">
                        <span class="mk-svc-hl">關節鬆動，</span><br/>
                        <span class="mk-svc-hl">讓動作回到正軌</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">鬆開卡住的關節活動度，透過精準的手法恢復關節該有的活動範圍，減少代償動作帶來的二次傷害。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg?v=3" alt="關節鬆動" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">02</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">筋膜張力平衡，從根源消除代償</span></div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">筋膜是串聯全身的網絡，一處緊繃可能牽動全身。我們從整體張力出發，重新校準你的身體，平衡全身筋膜張力鏈。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-02-stretch.jpg?v=3" alt="筋膜張力平衡" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">03</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">IASTM 筋膜刀精準修復</span></div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">使用專業器械精準處理軟組織沾黏，深入處理纖維化組織，打破沾黏循環，讓組織重新獲得彈性與滑動能力，加速修復與還原。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-03-personal.jpg?v=3" alt="IASTM 筋膜刀" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>
</data></odoo>
